I'll differ with the answer you got to this one. It isn't a priority yet,
when you want to save on holy water. You want the horn blessed when you
want it to have an effect as soon as possible. That is, when you're sick or
food poisoned. Don't eat spoiled food, and as long as you don't meet the
unique monsters that can make you sick (which will be much later), just use
the uncursed horn and keep trying until it works.

Later on, when you might experience cursing attacks, keep it blessed,
because a cursed horn is very bad news.

